OL,3,GNEWSABoy admits starting fire that
OL,4,Akilled elderly couple
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy threw a lit cigarette
OL,7,Finto a bin causing a fire which spread
OL,8,Fto a house killing the elderly couple
OL,9,Fwho lived there, a court has heard.
OL,11,FStan Rickman, 91, and his wife Roma,
OL,12,F88, were found dead at their home in
OL,13,FHeron Close, Alton, Hampshire, in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of 14 April 2025.
OL,16,FThe teenager, who cannot be named for
OL,17,Flegal reasons, pleaded guilty at
OL,18,FWinchester Crown Court to arson.
OL,19,FProsecutors offered no evidence to two
OL,20,Fcharges of manslaughter and one of
OL,21,Farson damaging the house, which he had
OL,22,Fdenied.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
